WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:05.734
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.868
Fox News announced today
that it has parted ways

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:09.300
with host Tucker Carlson,

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.901
and last Friday
was his final show,

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:13.367
which is great,
but also unsettling.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:16.067
At least when he had a show,
we knew where he was.

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:19.133
It's creepy trying
to fall asleep

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.267
with a ventriloquist dummy
in your room,

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.234
but it's way creepier
when you wake up

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:25.300
and it's not there anymore.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.467
"Huh.
That's weird.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:31.167
Oh, my God. Is it behind me?"

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:34.400
Also today, CNN parted ways
with anchor Don Lemon

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.567
amid accusations
of sexist behavior.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:39.634
Wow. Does anybody have
an opening for a sexist?

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:40.767
Oh, right.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:44.868
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:48.300
President Biden is reportedly
preparing to formally announce

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.501
he is running for reelection.

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:52.367
If successful,
he will be the oldest man...

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:57.400
That's it. Just the oldest man.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.767
That's right.
President Biden is reportedly

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:00.734
planning to formally announce
his reelection campaign

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:02.801
as early as this week,
which is frankly a little crazy.

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:04.434
He's going to be 82.

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:06.033
I think you should stop
running for president

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.367
when people start saying,

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.534
"Young" after your age.

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:14.133
"Joe here, 82 years young.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.968
Not only that, the leader
of the free world.

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:17.801
That's pretty nuts."

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:20.100
President Biden met today
with three Tennessee lawmakers

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.834
who led gun safety protests
at the state capitol.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:26.033
Meanwhile, Ron DeSantis
met with the guns.

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:31.334
Senate Judiciary Chair
Dick Durbin in a new interview

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:34.334
called for a code of conduct
for Supreme Court justices

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:38.534
because right now, the only rule
is no front flips off the yacht.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:40.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.667
New Jersey Governor
Phil Murphy

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:44.033
recently declared
that September 23rd

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:47.367
will be Bruce Springsteen Day,
as opposed to Jersey's previous

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:49.167
Springsteen Day,
all of them.

00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:51.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.734 --> 00:01:53.434
McDonald's has announced
it will offer

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:56.000
its Big Mac sauce on the side
for dipping,

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.734
or what the hell,
soaking.

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:00.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.534
New York officials
unveiled a plan today

00:02:02.534 --> 00:02:05.033
to install ten miles of bike
lanes throughout the city.

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:06.234
That story again --

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:08.434
New York officials
are adding ten more miles

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:10.434
of sometimes car lanes.

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:13.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.067
IKEA announced plans last week

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.534
to open up eight more stores
across the US,

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:19.701
or more likely,
will start to build them,

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:21.734
get frustrated, and give up.

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:25.968
According to a new study --

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:27.467
We've all done that.
We've all done it.

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:29.367
According to a new study,
Americans over 50

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:31.067
who play video games
feel overlooked

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:32.501
by the gaming industry.

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:35.200
For example, there is no option
to play "Grand Theft Auto"

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.400
with your left blinker
on the whole time.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.834 --> 00:02:41.801
That's right,
70% of older Americans

00:02:41.801 --> 00:02:43.634
who play video games
do not feel like products

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:44.934
are designed with them in mind

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:47.801
because when they tried it,
they failed miserably.

00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:51.767
[ Laughter, groans ]

00:02:55.067 --> 00:02:58.300
And that's sadly, because you
can't ever predict the future,

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.000
was our final joke...

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.234
of the monologue.

00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:03.701
You usually try
to close on a banger,

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:06.167
and sometimes, you close
on one that goes like that.

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:07.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.467 --> 00:03:09.968
President Biden announced today

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:11.434
that he is running
for reelection.

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:14.400
Can you imagine if it's Biden
versus Trump again?

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.667
That's like
going into a diner

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:19.934
and the only things on the menu
are two day old egg salad

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:22.434
and Donald Trump.

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:27.000
"I mean, I guess I'll take my
chances with the egg salad."

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.534
President Biden announced today

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:30.801
that he will run for a
second term and said,

00:03:30.801 --> 00:03:32.901
"Let's finish the job."
Yeah, good idea.

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:35.000
It would be nice
to have a country

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.501
where a guy could safely
retire before he's 86.

00:03:38.501 --> 00:03:40.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.334 --> 00:03:42.467
Following President Biden's
reelection announcement today,

00:03:42.467 --> 00:03:44.200
the Republican National
Committee released

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.701
an ad that asks,

00:03:45.701 --> 00:03:48.801
"What if the weakest president
we've ever had were re-elected?"

00:03:48.801 --> 00:03:51.734
And personally, I think it's
pretty low to drag

00:03:51.734 --> 00:03:53.634
Martin Van Buren into this.

00:03:53.634 --> 00:03:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.868 --> 00:04:03.434
Life's hard enough
with that silly haircut.

00:04:03.434 --> 00:04:05.834
According to reports, Fox News
CEO Suzanne Scott

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.701
did not tell Tucker Carlson
why he was being fired,

00:04:08.701 --> 00:04:11.734
but said that the decision
was made, "From above."

00:04:11.734 --> 00:04:14.701
But come on, we know all
the decisions at Fox News

00:04:14.701 --> 00:04:16.100
come from below.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.634 --> 00:04:20.534
The Georgia...

00:04:20.534 --> 00:04:23.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:23.267 --> 00:04:25.467
The Georgia prosecutor
investigating former

00:04:25.467 --> 00:04:27.267
President Trump's
alleged interference

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.167
into the 2020 election
said yesterday

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:31.601
that she would announce
potential charges this summer.

00:04:31.601 --> 00:04:34.467
I like that we're
spreading out Trump's crimes

00:04:34.467 --> 00:04:38.767
and just like microdosing
indictments.

00:04:38.767 --> 00:04:39.901
You know,
because like,

00:04:39.901 --> 00:04:41.701
when Netflix drops
an entire season at once,

00:04:41.701 --> 00:04:42.968
sure, it's fun that weekend,

00:04:42.968 --> 00:04:44.234
but then we have nothing
to look forward to.

00:04:44.234 --> 00:04:46.167
Once a week is way better.

00:04:46.167 --> 00:04:50.100
It's like Trump's the "Abbott
Elementary" of criminals.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:56.100
A man in Idaho recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.300
after he passed
a 40 pound weight

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.234
from hand to hand 100 times.

00:05:00.234 --> 00:05:03.167
That story again --
Not much to do in Idaho.

00:05:03.167 --> 00:05:06.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.501 --> 00:05:08.667
He didn't even know
Guinness was there.

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:11.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.868 --> 00:05:13.000
They were like,

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.868
"Hey, how many times
have you done that?"

00:05:15.868 --> 00:05:20.100
Moose -- A moose -- We like when
it starts "A moose."

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.934
A moose recently walked into
a movie theater in Alaska

00:05:22.934 --> 00:05:24.834
and ate popcorn
from the trash can.

00:05:24.834 --> 00:05:28.367
Or, as Regal Cinemas
calls it, a medium.

00:05:28.367 --> 00:05:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.734 --> 00:05:33.901
Now movie theaters,
you used to...

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.667
And finally, a former
Disney World employee

00:05:38.667 --> 00:05:40.667
was recently arrested
for allegedly

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:42.534
taking videos
of women's skirts.

00:05:42.534 --> 00:05:44.934
To be fair, they should have
known something was wrong

00:05:44.934 --> 00:05:47.501
when he showed up to work
with no pants on.

00:05:49.467 --> 00:05:52.467
After announcing his 2024
reelection campaign,

00:05:52.467 --> 00:05:54.567
President Biden delivered
a speech yesterday

00:05:54.567 --> 00:05:56.534
about his economic vision
for the country.

00:05:56.534 --> 00:05:58.300
That's right.
From now on,

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:02.601
the grandkids are getting $6
in their birthday cards.

00:06:02.601 --> 00:06:03.801
[ Laughter, cheers ]

00:06:03.801 --> 00:06:05.534
Vermont Senator
Bernie Sanders

00:06:05.534 --> 00:06:07.067
endorsed President
Biden yesterday

00:06:07.067 --> 00:06:10.100
and said he will do what he can
to make sure Biden is reelected.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.467
But if Biden loses,

00:06:11.467 --> 00:06:14.367
the two of them can always
go back to heckling the Muppets.

00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:16.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.534 --> 00:06:19.501
Following recent reports
of Justice Clarence Thomas's

00:06:19.501 --> 00:06:21.901
failure
to disclose lavish vacations

00:06:21.901 --> 00:06:24.234
and gifts from a wealthy
Republican donor,

00:06:24.234 --> 00:06:27.267
the Supreme Court released a
three page statement yesterday,

00:06:27.267 --> 00:06:29.100
signed by all nine justices

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:32.234
committing to follow
"foundational ethics

00:06:32.234 --> 00:06:34.534
and principles starting now.
I mean now.

00:06:34.534 --> 00:06:38.601
Okay, now. Damn it, Clarence!"

00:06:38.601 --> 00:06:40.801
That's right.
All nine Supreme Court justices

00:06:40.801 --> 00:06:41.901
signed a pledge to follow

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:44.000
"Foundational ethics
and principles."

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.901
Okay, but it wasn't all nine
of them we were worried about.

00:06:47.901 --> 00:06:49.767
I mean, Elena Kagan's
last vacation

00:06:49.767 --> 00:06:53.501
was to the Lincoln Memorial.

00:06:53.501 --> 00:06:56.267
Took the bus.

00:06:56.267 --> 00:06:57.834
In honor of
Lesbian Visibility Week,

00:06:57.834 --> 00:07:01.000
the cast of
"The L Word: Generation Q"

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.567
yesterday
visited the White House,

00:07:02.567 --> 00:07:05.100
said Tucker Carlson
to a house plant.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.400
A top aide to Republican
presidential hopeful

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.434
Vivek Ramaswamy said today

00:07:12.434 --> 00:07:14.234
that he will be polling
in second

00:07:14.234 --> 00:07:16.534
or third place
by the end of the year,

00:07:16.534 --> 00:07:19.334
unless, of course,
a fourth person joins the race.

00:07:19.334 --> 00:07:21.601
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.601 --> 00:07:23.801
The USDA announced yesterday

00:07:23.801 --> 00:07:26.033
that it is considering
making changes to limit

00:07:26.033 --> 00:07:28.801
the amount of salmonella
in some chicken products.

00:07:28.801 --> 00:07:32.167
I'm sorry,
they haven't already?

00:07:32.167 --> 00:07:34.434
"We're also considering
a three strikes rule

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:36.367
if it's secretly a pigeon."

00:07:36.367 --> 00:07:40.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.467
"You can get
away with it twice.:"

00:07:43.467 --> 00:07:45.400
Ben &amp; Jerry's co-founder,
Ben Cohen,

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:51.801
recently launched a new cannabis
line called Ben's Best Blnz.

00:07:51.801 --> 00:07:54.901
Hopefully it's a lot
more popular than Jerroin.

00:07:54.901 --> 00:07:59.434
[ Laughter, groans ]

00:07:59.434 --> 00:08:01.734
[ Applause ]

00:08:01.734 --> 00:08:02.868
It was easy to do

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:06.133
because we had
a pack lying around.

00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:08.200
Quarterback Aaron Rodgers
reportedly spent a week

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.767
in Costa Rica
at a spiritual healing center

00:08:10.767 --> 00:08:13.000
before officially signing
with the New York Jets.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.667
Which is like washing your car
right before it rains.

00:08:16.667 --> 00:08:18.367
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.367 --> 00:08:20.968
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
was photographed

00:08:20.968 --> 00:08:24.133
over the weekend at Coachella,
and even he couldn't believe

00:08:24.133 --> 00:08:27.534
how much they were
charging for water.

00:08:27.534 --> 00:08:29.133
And finally,
authorities in Mexico

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:31.801
recently seized
nearly 12,000 tequila bottles

00:08:31.801 --> 00:08:34.334
that contained concentrated
liquid meth.

00:08:34.334 --> 00:08:36.400
On the bright side,
Margarita night

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:40.067
ended with
a completely spotless house.

00:08:41.434 --> 00:08:45.501
When asked yesterday about his
age as he runs for reelection,

00:08:45.501 --> 00:08:48.467
President Biden said that it
doesn't register with him.

00:08:48.467 --> 00:08:51.767
Okay. I know you're trying
to play it cool,

00:08:51.767 --> 00:08:54.801
but you made it sound
like a symptom.

00:08:54.801 --> 00:08:59.167
"My age?
I never remember."

00:08:59.167 --> 00:09:00.934
That's right.
When asked about his age,

00:09:00.934 --> 00:09:03.200
President Biden said,
"I took a hard look at it

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.367
before I decided to run,
and I feel good."

00:09:05.367 --> 00:09:08.000
Listen, we don't care
how you feel now.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.300
Did you see what eight years
did to Obama?

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.467
If you get reelected,

00:09:13.467 --> 00:09:16.901
this is what you're going to
look like by the end of 2028.

00:09:16.901 --> 00:09:18.200
[ Laughter ]

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.901
President Biden greeted kids
today on the White House

00:09:21.901 --> 00:09:24.133
south lawn as part of
Take Your Child to Work Day.

00:09:24.133 --> 00:09:25.934
Unfortunately,
it was a trap set up

00:09:25.934 --> 00:09:28.067
by Congress
to arrest Hunter Biden.

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:31.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:31.534 --> 00:09:34.467
Former President Trump's
new book, "Letters to Trump",

00:09:34.467 --> 00:09:39.868
went on sale this week
for $95 -- $95.

00:09:39.868 --> 00:09:42.567
Let me give you the gist
and save you the cash.

00:09:42.567 --> 00:09:44.567
"Dear Mr. President,
for the last time,

00:09:44.567 --> 00:09:48.367
the Grimace cannot attend
your inauguration.

00:09:48.367 --> 00:09:50.300
We hope this will be
the final word on the matter.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.834
Sincerely, McDonald's."

00:09:52.834 --> 00:09:55.067
A source recently told
"People Magazine" that former

00:09:55.067 --> 00:09:57.467
President Trump respects
and admires former

00:09:57.467 --> 00:10:00.234
First Lady Melania Trump
and wants to make her happy.

00:10:00.234 --> 00:10:02.834
But he plans to stay
married to her anyway.

00:10:02.834 --> 00:10:04.934
[ Laughter ]

00:10:04.934 --> 00:10:07.334
After being fired
from Fox News on Monday,

00:10:07.334 --> 00:10:09.267
Tucker Carlson
posted a video last night

00:10:09.267 --> 00:10:10.601
to Twitter
and said,

00:10:10.601 --> 00:10:13.667
"Where can you still find
Americans saying true things?"

00:10:13.667 --> 00:10:16.100
Well, hell, you've already tried
Fox News and Twitter.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:21.501
I'm out of ideas. I don't know.
Maybe Wall Street.

00:10:21.501 --> 00:10:24.234
A bipartisan group of senators
yesterday introduced

00:10:24.234 --> 00:10:26.801
the Protecting Kids
on Social Media Act,

00:10:26.801 --> 00:10:30.167
which would set the minimum
age to 13 for platforms

00:10:30.167 --> 00:10:32.801
including Instagram,
Facebook, and TikTok.

00:10:32.801 --> 00:10:35.601
Wait, you're trying
to keep kids under 13

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:39.767
from using Facebook?
What's next?

00:10:39.767 --> 00:10:44.801
You're not going to let him wait
in line with you at the bank?

00:10:44.801 --> 00:10:48.567
Workers in Wales recently
misspelled the word "school"

00:10:48.567 --> 00:10:50.434
while repainting
a section of road.

00:10:50.434 --> 00:10:53.868
To be fair, this is how
you spell "school" in Welsh.

00:10:53.868 --> 00:10:59.067
[ Laughter ]

00:10:59.067 --> 00:11:00.934
A court in Germany
ruled yesterday

00:11:00.934 --> 00:11:04.467
that the tenants of a building
do not qualify for reduced rent

00:11:04.467 --> 00:11:06.400
because their landlords
sunbathed naked

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:07.767
in the courtyard.

00:11:07.767 --> 00:11:08.834
Said the judge,

00:11:08.834 --> 00:11:10.868
"Think of it this way --
free sundial."

00:11:10.868 --> 00:11:16.968
[ Laughter ]

00:11:16.968 --> 00:11:18.467
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,
yeah, yeah.

00:11:18.467 --> 00:11:21.501
I don't need your applause.

00:11:21.501 --> 00:11:25.200
But I stand by that joke.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.167
And finally,
according to a new report,

00:11:27.167 --> 00:11:30.000
trained dogs can help detect
coronavirus infections

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.133
in schools.

00:11:31.133 --> 00:11:33.868
Cats can, too.
They just won't.

00:11:33.868 --> 00:11:36.100
That was the monologue,
everybody. We're off.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:41.634
♪♪

